.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rev-stealth-config-gc 1  "rev-stealth-config-gc " 
.SH NAME
rev\-stealth\-config\-gc \- P6.4: Garbage\-collect `.bak.<epoch>` backups for the target config file, keeping the newest `\-\-keep` (default 5). All older backups are deleted; the current file is untouched
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrev\-stealth config gc\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-explain\fR] [\fB\-\-idempotency\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-keep\fR] [\fB\-\-target\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Garbage\-collect .bak.<epoch> backups for the target config file, keeping the newest \-\-keep (default 5). Older backups are deleted; the current file is never touched.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
v1.3 Lane G.5: side\-effect\-free plan emission. No file writes, no network calls, no keyring operations. Returns exit 0 after emitting the structured plan envelope
.TP
\fB\-\-explain\fR
v1.3 Lane G.5: include the action plan in the result envelope\*(Aqs `result.plan` field. Can be combined with `\-\-dry\-run`. When passed without `\-\-dry\-run`, the plan is emitted alongside the real action
.TP
\fB\-\-idempotency\-key\fR \fI<IDEMPOTENCY_KEY>\fR
v1.3 Lane G.5 / G.6: opaque caller\-supplied key for at\-most\-once commit semantics. Accepted in G.5; surfaced in the envelope; the underlying commit replay semantics land in G.6
.TP
\fB\-\-keep\fR \fI<KEEP>\fR [default: 5]
Number of newest backups to keep. Defaults to 5
.TP
\fB\-\-target\fR \fI<TARGET>\fR [default: policy]
Which file\*(Aqs backups to GC. Defaults to `policy`
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
policy
.IP \(bu 2
authorized
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  $ rev\-stealth config gc
  $ rev\-stealth config gc \-\-keep 10
  $ rev\-stealth config gc \-\-target authorized \-\-keep 3

EXIT CODES:
  0  Ok               GC completed.
  1  UserError        Bad \-\-keep / unknown target.
  3  PermanentError   directory IO failure.

ENV:
  REV_SCRAPING_POLICY      Override the policy.toml path.
  REV_SCRAPING_AUTHORIZED  Override the authorized.toml path.
